Replace the placeholders with the actual connections used in the prototype.

## 4. Power Supply

The prototype is powered using a low-voltage DC supply.

The ESP32 and sensors must operate within their specified voltage and current limits. Sensor outputs connected to ESP32 analog inputs must remain within the permitted input voltage range.

The circuit must be disconnected from the power supply before changing wiring or replacing components.

